1f:T924,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Why choose a custom WordPress theme development service over off-the-shelf marketplace themes?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Commercial marketplace themes are packed with tens of thousands of lines of unused code, dozens of required plugins, and slow database queries designed to fit every possible use case. A bespoke WordPress theme is built solely for your specific layout and business goals, resulting in 3x faster page speeds, superior Google rankings, and a backend that is remarkably easy to administer."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you achieve 95+ PageSpeed scores on WordPress websites?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I eliminate bulky plugin dependencies, serve responsive next-gen WebP images, inline critical CSS, defer non-essential scripts, enable server-side Redis object caching, and configure Cloudflare edge caching. Your site loads in fractions of a second even under heavy traffic spikes."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Will I be able to edit and update all content without knowing how to code?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, absolutely. Using Advanced Custom Fields (ACF Pro) and intuitive custom Gutenberg blocks, I build an effortless editorial dashboard. You can update headlines, photos, callout boxes, and links as easily as typing in a Google Doc, without any danger of breaking page layouts."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you migrate my existing content and preserve my Google search rankings?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. I ensure zero ranking drops by maintaining your exact URL structures, migrating all existing blog posts, images, and categories, and configuring 301 redirects for any modified routes. We verify all canonical tags and XML sitemaps before flipping the live switch."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you work with Elementor or only purely coded custom themes?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I am an experienced Elementor expert and regularly build custom themes that integrate Elementor Pro for marketing landing pages. However, I optimize Elementor setups by disabling unnecessary font files, stripping extraneous DOM nodes, and writing custom CSS widgets to guarantee performance remains exceptional."}}]}1d:["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1f"}}]
